// Weapon shapes. Volumes are real cm3 of material (steel 7.85 g/cm3: arming-sword blade 180 cm3 = 1.41 kg).
// Contact areas / penetration / velocity multipliers are estimates calibrated to DF feel (to be tuned in the Phase 0 melee spike).
// Wind-up/recover for dagger, sword, axe, maul, spear come from plan §4A.3; the rest are estimates.
